00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:53.580
Enhance says any PFOA is only an impurity, denies measurable leaching, and notes it never

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:55.800
joined the 2015 voluntary phase out.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:01:01.001
